# MZ77
LZ77 archiver software

on debian-based distros install libgtk-4-dev pkg-config for GTK4. On other
distros, good luck.

Building from a fresh checkout also needs autoconf, automake, libtool and
gnulib (on debian-based distros: autoconf automake libtool gnulib):

    ./bootstrap
    ./configure            # or --enable-debug / --enable-release
    make -j$(nproc)
    src/mz77

Further building steps described in INSTALL file.

The coursework report from May 2026 is kept in archive/report-2026-05.
